    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## MiniMax H3 · keyframes along your camera\n\n**Guide Frames** carries the anchor along the Director's move, **Keyframes** picks one every 2 s on the H3 grid, **Fill Reveal (AI)** paints what the camera uncovers, and **H3 Guides** anchors them inside the generation (core `MiniMaxH3AddGuide`, like the official *Multiframe Reference*, driven by a camera).\n\n- The anchor is also `<Picture 1>` (identity and style). **Camera → Prompt** adds the move and the Director's **look**.\n- Connect an **audio** to H3 Guides to anchor a soundtrack.\n- H3 files follow the official template. Turbo LoRA: Ctrl+B, steps 4."
   ]
  }
